                <mxCell id="2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Physical GPR SRAM Banks (1R1W per Bank; SIMT Width = 1024 bits)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(74, 20, 140);&quot;&gt;If rs1, rs2, rs3 hit different Banks, they fetch concurrently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(74, 20, 140);&quot;&gt;If they hit the SAME Bank (e.g. rs1=r1, rs2=r5 -&amp;gt; both hit Bank 1),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(74, 20, 140);&quot;&gt;XBAR generates Stall (has_collision=1) and reads over multiple cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
